00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:16.760
I mean, what's a robot or an alien?

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:20.980
Like, this is just sort of things that kind of blend together.

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:23.000
Like, ninjas and aliens.

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:25.140
Like, they kind of blend together for me too.

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:31.660
Yeah, right, right. And I feel like there are definitely some, you know, biological creatures here and robots.

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:34.980
I feel like the robots are just like part of the aliens arsenal.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:39.960
