00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:08.140
Yeah. The two player, you know, focus for Contra.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:09.960
So that sounds like it's going to be great.

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:12.040
Only one way to find out.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.800
Right, right. I guess that's what we're going to do on the episode.

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:21.840
This is a side-scrolling action platformer where two ninjas who have names, Talon and Blade.

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:24.420
Blade. Yeah, Blade's always a cool name.

