00:31:18.980 --> 00:31:21.520
Never knew that, but it was always right there.

00:31:21.940 --> 00:31:23.260
Yeah. That's why I read the title is important.

00:31:23.260 --> 00:31:24.200
The atrocities you committed.

00:31:25.780 --> 00:31:30.300
And when you get to the end of the game, it's just kind of like a quick text wrap up.

00:31:30.560 --> 00:31:33.440
The evil is destroyed and peace returns to the world.

00:31:33.680 --> 00:31:38.880
Not long after the war, the ninjas return to their homeland and back into the shadows of mystery.

00:31:39.220 --> 00:31:43.280
So ends another chapter in the glorious legend of the ninja.

00:31:43.280 --> 00:31:44.360
Ninja. Interesting.

00:31:45.860 --> 00:31:49.940
Like, are, are they like talking about ninjas as a whole?

00:31:50.140 --> 00:31:54.120
Like, this is another chapter in like ninja media?

00:31:54.480 --> 00:31:57.300
Or is this just like, you know, it's kind of vague.

00:31:57.520 --> 00:31:59.480
They're not talking about talent and blade at all.

00:31:59.480 --> 00:32:08.520
Like, like, like I said earlier, like, you know, the ancient ones are just sort of like this organizational, international organization, NGO.

00:32:09.120 --> 00:32:12.920
The ninjas are a similar situation.

00:32:12.920 --> 00:32:16.920
Um, it's like more, it's like AFL, CIO, SAG.

00:32:17.520 --> 00:32:20.600
Um, ninjas is just like a labor union.

00:32:21.100 --> 00:32:24.300
Um, and there's, you know, they've been a union for a long time.

00:32:24.660 --> 00:32:25.560
So they have a legend.

00:32:25.560 --> 00:32:33.480
We, we've seen a lot of games where, uh, the end screens or just text in general is kind of bad English.

00:32:33.780 --> 00:32:39.140
But do you think it's on purpose that ninjas is imploralized and it's just ninja?

00:32:39.440 --> 00:32:41.940
The ninja returned to their homeland?

00:32:42.300 --> 00:32:46.500
No, I think it's, uh, I think that's the, that's, I think that's the plural.

00:32:46.940 --> 00:32:49.060
The plural of ninja is ninja?

00:32:49.420 --> 00:32:50.460
Yeah. It's like fish.

00:32:50.940 --> 00:32:51.860
No, I like that.

00:32:51.860 --> 00:32:53.060
It sounds right. Yeah.

00:32:53.280 --> 00:32:55.480
I like it too. I just, I never thought about it.

00:32:55.660 --> 00:32:56.760
It doesn't bother me to hear like the ninja always.

00:32:56.760 --> 00:32:58.580
I am making, I am guessing.

00:32:58.920 --> 00:33:02.320
I'm, I'm kind of just trying to play along.

00:33:02.620 --> 00:33:06.440
It does kind of sound like it could be a reason, but I don't actually know.

00:33:07.320 --> 00:33:16.180
Maybe most importantly, what is the message from the devs about this whole return to the animal kingdom to help you stop the aliens from taking Earth?

00:33:16.360 --> 00:33:19.680
Are they saying we should be kind, uh, to mother nature?

00:33:19.980 --> 00:33:21.480
Is that, is that the message here?

00:33:22.540 --> 00:33:25.820
Probably not. I mean, if they're saying that tigers are cool.

00:33:28.200 --> 00:33:30.240
Yeah, I think maybe, maybe it is.

00:33:30.360 --> 00:33:32.260
