A hammer is actually better, but I would appreciate either.

00:41:56.440 --> 00:41:58.940
All right, look, here's the scoop on Ninja Crusaders.

00:41:59.160 --> 00:42:06.760
I started playing this game and I pretty much like wrote it off and then, you know, went about my day.

00:42:06.880 --> 00:42:09.400
And then I started doing the notes for this game.

00:42:09.460 --> 00:42:10.560
And I said, let me try this again.

00:42:11.220 --> 00:42:12.620
And then I was like, wait a minute.

00:42:13.100 --> 00:42:14.140
There's a game here.

00:42:15.440 --> 00:42:17.240
And it's really fun.

00:42:17.240 --> 00:42:20.620
I had a really fun time with Ninja Crusaders.

00:42:21.060 --> 00:42:24.320
But not like Ninja Gaiden levels of fun.

00:42:24.460 --> 00:42:26.660
Like not like essential games list levels of fun.

00:42:26.760 --> 00:42:29.680
Because it's really, it feels kind of unfinished.

00:42:29.680 --> 00:42:34.480
For as great of a game as it is, it's very short.

00:42:34.700 --> 00:42:38.820
It's very like lackluster in specific moments.

00:42:39.300 --> 00:42:47.180
And I think the animal transformation thing was just enough to keep me to be like, no, no, no, wait.

00:42:47.240 --> 00:42:49.100
This is cool. Like you should see this through.

00:42:49.100 --> 00:42:52.820
And I did get through this game.

00:42:52.980 --> 00:42:59.520
I did get through this game, surprisingly, without like, without any trouble or anything after I just continued to go at it.

00:42:59.640 --> 00:43:02.980
And so I would say like, it's a competent game.

00:43:02.980 --> 00:43:04.200
It's not too cheap.

00:43:04.200 --> 00:43:05.880
It respects your time.

00:43:06.460 --> 00:43:07.360
It's well made.

00:43:07.520 --> 00:43:10.300
And so like, those are all the things that should put it on the essential games list.

00:43:10.360 --> 00:43:13.680
But I feel like it's one third of a great game.

00:43:13.680 --> 00:43:16.560
And we deserve those other two third parts.

00:43:16.740 --> 00:43:21.780
So like, I definitely think if you have a friend, this is worth checking out.

00:43:21.780 --> 00:43:23.180
But I don't even think you need the friend.

00:43:23.440 --> 00:43:31.600
I think if you just have some patience in an afternoon, Ninja Crusaders is a pretty tight game that's worth most NES fans time.

00:43:31.820 --> 00:43:36.100
But it's not enough to put it on the bigger list of the essential games list.

00:43:36.400 --> 00:43:38.200
Sean? Yeah.

00:43:38.400 --> 00:43:41.520
And like Mike said, it's important that it's the afternoon.

00:43:41.520 --> 00:43:43.280
Do not play this game at night.

00:43:44.260 --> 00:43:45.480
It's like the Gremlins.

00:43:45.720 --> 00:43:49.520
Very scary at night. It's very bad things happen if you play this game at night.

00:43:49.520 --> 00:43:52.720
But anyway, I'm kind of in the same boat here.

00:43:54.580 --> 00:44:03.720
As much praise as I gave this game in the episode Body, I would say that there's still a lot of jank.

00:44:04.040 --> 00:44:09.180
