00:44:12.680 --> 00:44:16.760
It just sort of like, they just kind of do shit.

00:44:16.760 --> 00:44:23.080
And maybe like that, I was kind of put off by it.

00:44:24.280 --> 00:44:32.240
So, while I said earlier, and I still agree, that your character control is great.

00:44:32.280 --> 00:44:39.660
And it feels like you have a lot of, like, your failings are your problem.

00:44:40.020 --> 00:44:42.920
And, you know, kind of stuff like that.

00:44:43.360 --> 00:44:45.400
The enemies just feel strange.

00:44:45.400 --> 00:44:48.400
It feels like you're in a world that's just a little off.

00:44:49.900 --> 00:44:52.600
And that kind of pervades the entire game.

00:44:52.800 --> 00:44:55.800
So, you know, I won't drag this out anymore.

00:44:55.800 --> 00:44:59.300
I'll just say it is a play it, but it is not essential.

00:44:59.760 --> 00:45:01.840
Joe? Oh, I'm kind of sad.

00:45:02.100 --> 00:45:05.080
I think I, you know, I don't have any power now.

00:45:05.220 --> 00:45:07.680
But I did want to put this on the essential games list.

00:45:08.680 --> 00:45:10.640
I had a great time with this game.

00:45:10.660 --> 00:45:15.880
I know you guys did too. But I feel like I just really didn't have much to complain about for this.

00:45:15.980 --> 00:45:23.320
At first, I was going to, when I first picked this up, I was like, well, the one hit KO is going to keep it off for me right off the bat.

00:45:23.340 --> 00:45:25.440
But I did come around on that.

00:45:25.540 --> 00:45:31.760
I got used to that. And I felt like the game is designed around it in a way that feels fair.

00:45:33.300 --> 00:45:41.500
And I just had such a good time with the different animals, the balance between, like we were talking about the balance between the animals and the weapons.

00:45:41.800 --> 00:45:46.220
And each animal, each weapon feeling different and bringing something different to the table.

00:45:47.480 --> 00:45:48.880
I don't know. It just felt clean.

00:45:49.100 --> 00:45:51.200
One of the better shmups we've played in a long time.

00:45:52.420 --> 00:45:55.960
But in seriousness, I do think it's one of the better platformers we've played in a while.

00:45:57.680 --> 00:45:58.760
So, I don't know.

00:45:58.980 --> 00:46:01.900
I think this is a great, you know, definitely.

00:46:03.060 --> 00:46:09.800
If you were playing this in two-player, I'd say this is absolutely 100% an essential game.

00:46:09.940 --> 00:46:12.940
And even playing in one player, personally, I still say it's essential.

00:46:13.240 --> 00:46:14.120
But, I don't know.

00:46:14.120 --> 00:46:15.160
Yeah, go on record.

00:46:15.280 --> 00:46:17.400
Give it a play and give us your thoughts.

00:46:17.500 --> 00:46:20.700
