Because it is a relatively, like, short and small experience.

00:46:52.780 --> 00:46:57.260
I can't get over that, like, the boss battles are kind of, like, whatever.

00:46:57.720 --> 00:47:01.780
And so, really, like, the moment to moment is fun.

00:47:01.900 --> 00:47:04.180
But, like, when I look back on it, it's like, will I remember it?

00:47:04.240 --> 00:47:09.420
And so, that's why I left it off just thinking, like, you know, we've got the best of coming up soon.

00:47:09.600 --> 00:47:11.140
Like, I could raise it again there.

